{"ID":"20240205153702-8fassp5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153702-8fassp5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153702-8fassp5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113644-tzgxw2z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619170049-59by33h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1247,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619170049-59by33h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"鸡血藤","type":"doc","updated":"20240903092817"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113644-tzgxw2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113644-tzgxw2z","updated":"20240206113653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于云南、广西、广东等地。\n【性状】\t该品为椭圆形、长矩圆形或不规则的斜切片，厚0.31cm。栓皮灰棕色，有的可见灰白色斑，栓皮脱落处现红棕色。切面木部红棕色或棕色，导管孔多数；韧皮部有树脂状分泌物呈红棕色至黑棕色，与木部相间排列呈38个偏心性半圆形环；骨部偏向一侧。质坚硬。气微，味涩。\n【性味】\t苦、甘，温。\n【功效】\t补血，活血，通络。用于月经不调，血虚萎黄，麻木瘫痪，风湿痹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113643-kq1svey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113643-kq1svey","updated":"20240206113643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113643-qzw6nbr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163105-m5xufs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163105-m5xufs9","updated":"20240205163105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 651px;","style":"width: 641px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡血藤"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡血藤-20240205163105-crr3lh9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Typ